      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Usuarios activos que no son premium",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Usuarios activos que no son premium",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "flfkTfaW4Ksshw-Lv6jjm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375.9017617631354,
      "y": 324.7386753904018,
      "width": 591.5996704101562,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 748853999,
      "version": 1447,
      "versionNonce": 1357805231,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774364709689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Array /\nCreate a new array to store users\nIterate elements in the active users -> O(n)\nFor each element iterate elements in premium users -> O(n2)\nValidate if active user is different to premium user\nAppend it to the list\nQuadratic time complexity -> O(n2)\n\nSet /\nCreate a new array to store users\nConvert premium users to a Set -> O(n)\nIterate elements in the array -> O(n)\nValidate if the element does not belongs to the set  -> O(1)\nAppend it to the list\nLinear time complexity -> O(2n) -> O(n)\n\nSet/\nIf both are sets \nSubtract from A elements of -> \nLinear time complexity B O(n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Array /\nCreate a new array to store users\nIterate elements in the active users -> O(n)\nFor each element iterate elements in premium users -> O(n2)\nValidate if active user is different to premium user\nAppend it to the list\nQuadratic time complexity -> O(n2)\n\nSet /\nCreate a new array to store users\nConvert premium users to a Set -> O(n)\nIterate elements in the array -> O(n)\nValidate if the element does not belongs to the set  -> O(1)\nAppend it to the list\nLinear time complexity -> O(2n) -> O(n)\n\nSet/\nIf both are sets \nSubtract from A elements of -> \nLinear time complexity B O(n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mLvTfrD2P19-OL-gAlUUt",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 935.0542016131119,
      "y": 125.77697656951443,
      "width": 66.4921875,
